2. MOTION SYSTEM

Motion should communicate hierarchy and interaction.

Never animate something merely because the framework can.

All possible animations should use:

useNativeDriver: true

for opacity and transform.

Respect:

reduceMotion

If enabled, reduce animation to near-instant opacity changes or disable nonessential motion.

Durations

instant: 100ms
fast:    160ms
base:    220ms
medium:  280ms
slow:    360ms

Navigation

Interaction| Motion
Stack push| slide from right, 260ms
Stack pop| slide right, 240ms
Tab switch| content fade, 180ms
Modal| slide from bottom, 280ms
Fullscreen media| fade, 220ms
Auth| fade, 240ms
Content hub| image fade + content rise
Community| content fade
Search| soft fade/slide

Micro-interactions

Button:

scale 0.97 → 1

Fandom chip:

scale 0.96 → 1

Reaction:

scale 0.5 → 1.15 → 1

Follow:

label crossfade
background → accentMuted

Spoiler:

opacity + maxHeight expansion

Poster:

scale 0.98 on press

Sheet:

translateY → 0
spring

Skeleton:

opacity 0.35 ↔ 0.7

