29. OFFLINE / LOADING / ERROR

Every screen must have deliberate states.

State| Behavior
Loading| Layout-matched skeleton
Empty| Helpful EmptyState + CTA
Error| Inline message + Retry
Offline| Cached content + offline banner
Success| Toast/check feedback

Never leave users staring at an infinite spinner.

Never display technical error codes to normal users.

