31. PERFORMANCE

The interface must prioritize real mobile performance.

Use:

- FlatList / FlashList where appropriate
- Image caching
- Lazy loading
- Pagination
- Skeleton placeholders
- Optimistic interactions where safe
- Minimal re-renders
- Native-driven animation
- Avoid unnecessary blur
- Avoid huge full-resolution images
- Avoid animation overload

Premium does not mean expensive computation.

